  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cyber Security Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is intended to bolster cybersecurity measures by assisting host government and operators in developing and implementing effective policies, procedures, and hardware/software solutions. Furthermore, it will contribute to workforce development initiatives aimed at enhancing prevention, protection, preparedness and response.</narrative>
  </description>
